## Interface: 30300
## Title: Journal
## Notes: A retail-style journal in one window: every dungeon and raid with its bosses, abilities, loot and quests, every quest of the realm by zone, a directory of trainers, flight masters, banks and other townsfolk, a codex of each zone's lore that fills in as you play, and every mount, pet and toy with where to get it. Other addons add tabs of their own. Shift-J, /journal, /quests, /directory, /lore, /mounts, /pets, /toys. Backed by the mod-forever-journal server module.
## Author: buildthehomelab
## Version: 2.4.0
## OptionalDeps: DragonUI
## SavedVariables: JournalDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: JournalCharDB

